<h2>Testing through active projects</h2>
<p>Physical model projects involve many connected decisions—from scope and materials to fabrication, approvals, and delivery. Our current testing program allows selected partners to use the Portal during active projects and provide feedback on how clearly it supports <a href="/model-making-process">the model-making process</a>.</p>
<p>We are using this period to improve milestone visibility, file exchange, approvals, communication, and the overall client experience before the broader release.</p>

<h2>Launching January 2027</h2>
<p>The Carve Studio Portal is planned to launch more broadly in January 2027. Until then, access will remain limited to selected partners participating in the testing program.</p>
<p>Our goal is to make every project easier to follow: what has been decided, what requires attention, what happens next, and where the project stands.</p>
